      "message": "Instead of changing it here, should we actually change where we set implicit_null_checks_ to true. i.e. change in Runtime::Init (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/runtime/runtime.cc;l\u003d1886;) to check for ART_USE_RESTRICTED_MODE and not set it to true.",
