      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T10:07:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are actually two different variables here: `CompilerOptions::implicit_*_checks_` and `Runtime::implicit_*_checks_`. This change previously only affected the `CompilerOptions::implicit_*_checks_` as this is what affects the compiler inserting the implicit checks into the code which is what we want to prevent.\n\nHaving given this more thought, I think it\u0027s better to be more conservative here and disable implicit checks in both the compiler and runtime to ensure there is no mismatch between the two. I have made this change where we initialise the implicit checks instead of the getters.",
