      "writtenOn": "2025-02-05T15:30:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, when there is $compile$ we just return true and don\u0027t check for what instructions are there. Is the onus on the users of $compile$ to mark it only on the functions that have all instructions that are supported in the simulator?",
