      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we just return early at the start of method. Something like on line 1128 at the very start? \n```\n// TODO(Simulator): Reenable compilation of intrinsics.\n#ifdef ART_USE_RESTRICTED_MODE\n  return nullptr;\n#endif\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1162,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1162,
        "endChar": 31
