      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not very familiar with this code but is this just an optimization to avoid pushing a couple of arguments onto the stack? Or is it somehow not safe to do this for critical native?  If it is just an optimization can we just not set `kAccCriticalNative` when `ART_USE_RESTRICTED_MODE` is set and not special case this here.",
